Q: BeanCreationException: Error creating bean with name &#39;simpleMeterRegistry&#39; is thrown on adding eureka server to spring boot Applicatio A: <p>It seems your problem is because of using Lists without adding its dependency in Maven</p>
<p>Add the code below to your POM:</p>
<pre class="lang-xml prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;dependency&gt;
    &lt;groupId&gt;com.google.guava&lt;/groupId&gt;
